    title: "The Vintage Leather Jacket Guide: From Moto to Bomber Styles",
    excerpt: "The vintage leather jacket guide for moto, bomber, racer, and flight cuts. Authentication tells, era markers, and the brands serious collectors chase today.",
    // No shared placeholder fallback: a single hardcoded Unsplash URL here made
    // every heroless post render the SAME image (all identical on the index).
